class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>相<span class=\"color-value\"></span>信<span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>相<span class=\"color-value\"></span>信<span class=\"color-value\"></span>她<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span>相<span class=\"color-value\"></span>信<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191105</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>化工厂中心的空地上，一个巨大的戈德堡装置已经几近完整。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>水泥柱排列出一条幽深而空旷的黑暗，繁复的架构立足其间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>——和我预想的有一定差距，不过不会影响最后的效果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>其实……有件事，我一直不太明白……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>烟雾处理装置，会需要这么多——嗯——会爆炸的东西吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>作为一个实习生，你的观察力相当敏锐～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩俏皮地眨眨眼，后退一步上下打量起已经接近完成的“杰作”来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>不过呢，这只都是一些相关成分而已。不用担心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>那它现在是完成了吗？如果是完成了，我们就快点一起回去——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>但是这里的回路还需要调整一下。嗯，你说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>回去的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>哦，回去！当然了。不回去的话我去哪儿呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我也不会忘了刚才说的话。你的推荐信，我都记着呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……！好的！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>嗯嗯，所以……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>麻烦把从那边的“强力净化3.0”上拆下来的开闭单元递给我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>好的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩重新蹲下，把零件拿在装置的低处比划。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-301013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-301013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-301013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>不行。这个尺寸不对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-301013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-301013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-301013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>唉，这种时候还是需要拉普拉斯的“万能工具箱5.0”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>如果你带来了那东西就好了。当然，现在我只是说说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>拉普拉斯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-301010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-301010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-301010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>嗯？怎么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……不，没什么！那不重要……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>我在想，如果我们回去太晚，你的父母会担心的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-301013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-301013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-301013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话音落下，小春雀儿察觉到一瞬间的气氛变化，但她无从了解原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面前的男孩重新站起来。身旁漂浮的物件，也随着操纵者身体转向而动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的眼睛像月牙一样弯起，表情却实在不像任何先前已知的笑脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>如果是这件事，那可能反而是最不需要担心的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>嗯？为什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>现在……能麻烦你去看看你的“同伴们”都走到哪里了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我觉得他们已经迷路太久了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_zhou\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小春雀儿于刚才找到的缝隙附近徘徊，为她指明方向的小狗仍然不知所踪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>缝隙越来越大了……那个神秘术道具的效果好像在逐渐消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>嗯，是的。但他们还没有发现这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>我只需要这一点时间……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>童子军们仍未发现这里。他们原地打转，仿佛科尼岛的旋转木马。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这个发现使她稍微安心，又因放松而勾起一些针对前事的愧疚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>也许，泽维尔和他的父母，关系并不融洽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>也许有什么别的原因……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她攥紧了怀表，摩挲着上面金属光滑的表面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>总之，我不该……不应该未经调查就自说自话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>承认错误，及时道歉。这也是童子军素养的一部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>嗯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩回头望去，化工厂水泥浇筑的轮廓在不远处露出一角，并不如往常一样灰烟缭绕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>出来很久了。该回去了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_gongchangneibu_wuren.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-301011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-301011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-301011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>哦！你回来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>时间正好。看，它已经完成了。现在，我们只需要一个绝佳的观众席——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我认为烟囱里面就很不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>泽维尔先生，你怎么在那里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从小春雀儿的方向看过去，他的半个身子已经站在了“烟囱”里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我说过了，是“X”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>X先生……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>嘘，先别说话。让我们赶紧弄完，在回去的路上慢慢说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>但是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>你能自己上来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>可、可以！我马上来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小春雀儿攀上水泥平台，顺利把自己也藏匿进去。尽管她并不明白即将会发生什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><b>《童子军手册》素养篇Ⅷ：专注仔细，减少提问。</b></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>站稳了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>是的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>好。那接下来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>让我们开始吧。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FX-05"}}